abstract: >-
  EpiStat is a free, mobile-friendly, open-source web application
  reimplementing the core statistical modules of epidemiologic practice:
  stratified analysis (Mantel-Haenszel adjusted odds/risk ratio,
  Breslow-Day homogeneity test), R x C contingency tables, standardized
  mortality ratios (seven significance test/CI methods), matched
  case-control studies (McNemar's test), dose-response trend testing, WHO
  Child Growth Standards z-scores, person-time analysis, and sample
  size/power calculations across 9 study-design subtypes. Every module is
  independently validated against OpenEpi, documented in VALIDATION.md.
  The app runs entirely client-side as an installable, offline-capable
  Progressive Web App, with no data collection.
